        "content": "## Adapter: Hot Lead Alert\n**Demo sink** - writes to n8n Data Table `lead_notifications` in place of a real-time alert channel.\n\n**Swap to production (1 node):** replace \"Insert lead_notifications\" with a Slack node -> \"Send Message\" (post to a #hot-leads channel using the same fields: name, company, score, reasoning), or an Email/Teams node.\n\nOnly called when score >= 70 (hot lead threshold), in parallel with the CRM upsert.\n\nInput contract (from Execute Workflow Trigger, passthrough): leadId, email, name, company, score, reasoning.",
